Package: chaoticds
Type: Package
Title: Extreme Value Analysis for Chaotic Dynamical Systems
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Diogo Ribeiro <dfr@esmad.ipp.pt>
Maintainer: Diogo Ribeiro <dfr@esmad.ipp.pt>
Authors@R: c(person("Diogo", "Ribeiro", email = "dfr@esmad.ipp.pt", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2022-7072")))
Description: Toolkit for simulation and extreme-value analysis of chaotic
    dynamical systems. Includes logistic, Henon, tent, Lozi, and cat-map
    generators plus block maxima, peaks-over-threshold (POT), and extremal
    index estimators. Provides threshold diagnostics, bootstrap confidence
    intervals, clustering analysis, dependence checks, and publication-ready
    visualizations.
Keywords: chaotic systems, extreme value theory, time series, extremal index,
    threshold diagnostics, statistical computing
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/DiogoRibeiro7/chaotic-dynamical-systems, https://diogoribeiro7.github.io/chaotic-dynamical-systems
BugReports: https://github.com/DiogoRibeiro7/chaotic-dynamical-systems/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
